    {
      "id": "b000021",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 31,
      "end_line": 36,
      "raw": "1. Run `01_schema.sql` to create tables, constraints, and indexes.\n2. Run `02_sample-data.sql` to seed customers, products, inventory, and initial stock history.\n3. Run `03_procedures.sql` to create stored procedures for inventory adjustment, order creation, and order cancellation.\n4. Execute `CreateOrder` with an `OrderItemRequest` table-valued parameter to create an order through SQL.\n5. Run queries from `04_reports.sql` to inspect sales, best-selling products, inventory, and customer order history.\n6. Use `INTERVIEW_NOTES.md` to explain the design in an interview.\n",
      "items": [
        {
          "marker": "1.",
          "text": "Run `01_schema.sql` to create tables, constraints, and indexes.",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "2.",
          "text": "Run `02_sample-data.sql` to seed customers, products, inventory, and initial stock history.",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "3.",
          "text": "Run `03_procedures.sql` to create stored procedures for inventory adjustment, order creation, and order cancellation.",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "4.",
          "text": "Execute `CreateOrder` with an `OrderItemRequest` table-valued parameter to create an order through SQL.",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "5.",
          "text": "Run queries from `04_reports.sql` to inspect sales, best-selling products, inventory, and customer order history.",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "6.",
          "text": "Use `INTERVIEW_NOTES.md` to explain the design in an interview.",
          "checked": null
        }
      ]
